    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d170">

                <pb facs="0248" n="178" xml:id="pg178"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 185.161/1: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-05T11:00:00-05:00"
                            >December 5, 1918—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 2 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. French Government requested that Gompers be asked to go over soon as his
                    influence would be useful in Germany. Has President reached a decision as to
                    this matter?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
